bId = fields[2].isEmpty() ? 0 : Long.parseLong(fields[2]);\n        // ... parse remaining fields\n\n        return event;\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Parsing CSV Notes\n- Use `split(\",\", -1)` to preserve empty trailing fields\n- Always check for empty strings before parsing numbers\n- Use default values (0, \"\") for empty fields\n- Handle `long` for IDs (they can be very large numbers)\n\n## Flink Tuple Types\n```java\nimport org.apache.flink.api.java.tuple.Tuple2;\n\n// Tuple2 toString() produces: (field0,field1)\nTuple2<Long, Long> result = new Tuple2<>(12345L, 42L);\n// result.toString() -> \"(12345,42)\"\n```\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"61aa8f77-a454-4c4f-938a-33591327b05a"}
